{
  "_readme": [
    "Repo -> functional domain mapping. Two tables, both keyed EXACTLY, never by substring:",
    "  repos: { '<repo-name>': { region, category } }  - explicit overrides, win over teams",
    "  teams: { '<team-slug>': { region, category } }  - owning GitHub team -> Compass taxonomy",
    "Keys starting with '_' are ignored. A repo with no repo override and no mapped owning",
    "team is reported as 'Unmapped' - never as a blank cell or a homepage hostname.",
    "Generate the team list and the unmapped remainder with: npm run domains:seed"
  ],
  "_taxonomy": {
    "regions": ["Mastery Central", "Mastery West", "Mastery International", "IT Ops", "Applied Technology"],
    "categories": ["Alchemy", "Core Load", "Load Execution", "Back Office & Accounting", "Asset Resources", "EDI"]
